# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000063> (disease course)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000063> "The totality of all processes through which a given disease instance is realized."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000232> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OGMS_0000063> "replace 'OBI:occurrence of disease', need to add logical definition
The axioms of OBI occurence of disease:
Equivalent classes:
realizes some disease
Superclasses:
'has part' some 'pathologic process'
'has participant' some 
    (organism
     and ('has role' some 'host of immune response role'))
biological_process
realizes some 'host of immune response role'")
